{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07347","headline":"归沛县道中晚泊留侯城 · 刘长卿","name":"归沛县道中晚泊留侯城","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"访古此城下，子房安在哉？\n白云去不反，危堞空崔嵬。\n伊昔楚汉时，颇闻经济才。\n运筹风尘下，能使天地开。\n蔓草日已积，长松日已摧。\n功名满青史，祠庙唯苍苔。\n百里暮程远，孤舟川上回。\n进帆东风便，转岸前山来。\n楚水澹相引，沙鸥闲不猜。\n扣舷从此去，延首仍裴回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07347.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07347","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}